===Etymology===
{{etydate|1344}}. {{inh+|ru|orv|дьржава}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*dьržava}}. Cognates include {{cog|uk|держа́ва||[[strength]]; [[estate]]; [[state]] {{gloss|government}}, [[power]]}}, {{cog|be|дзяржа́ва||[[state]] {{gloss|government}}}}, {{cog|cu|дрьжава}}, {{m|cu|дръжава}}, {{cog|bg|държа́ва||[[state]] {{gloss|government}}}}, {{cog|mk|држава||[[state]] {{gloss|government}}}}, {{cog|sh|др̀жава||[[possession]]; [[state]] {{gloss|government}}}}, {{cog/sl-tonal|držȃva|t=[[composition]], [[content]]; [[state]], [[power]]; [[possession]]}}, {{cog|cs|država||[[possession]]; [[power]], [[state]]}}, {{cog|sk|dŕžava||[[state]], [[power]]}}, {{cog|pl|dzierżawa||[[lease]]; {{q|archaic}} [[possession]]}}.

